    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, when you hit a creature with a melee weapon attack, you can expend a spell slot to deal radiant damage to the target, in addition to the weapons damage. The extra damage is 2d6 for a 1st level spell slot, plus 1d6 for each spell level higher then 1st, to a maximum of 6d6.</p><p>In addition, the creature has disadvantage on attack rolls against creatures other then you until the end of your next turn. For each spell level higher then 1st, you may choose an additional creature within 10 feet of you to suffer this effect until the end of your next turn.</p><p>A melee weapon attack can benefit from either your @UUID[Compendium.wc5e-foundryvtt.class-features.Item.Ov302PGWIjkK2Jz3]{Crusader Strike} or Divine Bulwark feature, but only one such effect can be applied to an attack.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
